{"id": "d42b5909-7c36-4a31-8749-ef23afab9cbf", "slug": "quantum-telemetry-nexus", "title": "Quantum Telemetry Nexus", "description": "Quantum Telemetry Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Quantum Telemetry Nexus\"\ndescription: \"Quantum Telemetry Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#00F0FF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#38BDF8\"\n  background: \"#030408\"\n  surface: \"#64748B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Quantum Telemetry Nexus\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 7; favorites: 8; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nQuantum Telemetry Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nLink Established Telemetry Nexus Primary quantum manifold stabilized. Neural routing protocols active and awaiting secondary handshake. Encryption cipher locked. Uplink V.9.4.1 Core Diagnostics NODE ALPHA 98 Auxiliary P…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Telemetry Nexus.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #00F0FF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #38BDF8, background #030408, surface #64748B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and JetBrains Mono for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Quantum Telemetry Nexus</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@300;400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030408] text-slate-300 antialiased overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-cyan-500/30\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background Layer (Dither & Laser) -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"opacity: 0.9;\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Global Grid Framing & Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0 flex justify-center\">\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[1400px] h-full relative\">\n            <!-- Vertical Container Boundaries -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-4 lg:left-12 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/[0.04]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-slate-600\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-slate-600\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-4 lg:right-12 top-0 bottom-0 w-px bg-white/[0.04]\">\n                <div class=\"absolute top-24 -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-slate-600\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 -left-[1.5px] w-[4px] h-[4px] bg-slate-600\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Horizontal Structural Lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-24 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/[0.04]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-24 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-white/[0.04]\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Diagonal Texture Overlay -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-10 mix-blend-screen\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent, transparent 3px, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 3px, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 4px);\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Envelope -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-[1400px] mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center px-4 lg:px-12 py-12 lg:py-24\">\n\n        <!-- Framed Layout Wrapper -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full h-full flex flex-col pt-8 pb-12\">\n\n            <!-- Framing Corner Brackets -->\n            <svg class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 stroke-cyan-500/50\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M1 32V1H32\"/></svg>\n            <svg class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 stroke-cyan-500/50\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M31 32V1H0\"/></svg>\n            <svg class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-8 h-8 stroke-cyan-500/50\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M1 0v31h31\"/></svg>\n            <svg class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-8 h-8 stroke-cyan-500/50\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M31 0v31H0\"/></svg>\n\n            <!-- Header -->\n            <header class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-start md:items-end px-4 lg:px-8 mb-12 anim-item\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-xl\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n                        <div class=\"h-[1px] w-8 bg-cyan-500/50\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-cyan-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,240,255,0.4);\">Link Established</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-light tracking-tight text-white mb-4\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 0 10px rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\">\n                        Telemetry <span class=\"font-normal text-transparent bg-clip-text\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #00f0ff, #3b82f6); -webkit-background-clip: text;\">Nexus</span>\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed max-w-md\">\n                        Primary quantum manifold stabilized. Neural routing protocols active and awaiting secondary handshake. Encryption cipher locked.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"mt-8 md:mt-0 flex flex-col items-end text-right gap-2\">\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-1.5 opacity-80\" id=\"status-bars\">\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-4 bg-cyan-500/30\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-6 bg-cyan-400 shadow-[0_0_8px_#00f0ff]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-3 bg-cyan-500/30\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-1.5 h-5 bg-cyan-500/30\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-widest\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">Uplink V.9.4.1</span>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n\n            <!-- Grid Layout Structure -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-0 lg:border border-white/[0.05] relative z-10\" style=\"background: rgba(5, 7, 12, 0.6); backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\">\n\n                <!-- Internal Grid Lines (Visible on Desktop) -->\n                <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-4/12 w-px bg-white/[0.05] z-20\"></div>\n                <div class=\"hidden lg:block absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-8/12 w-px bg-white/[0.05] z-20\"></div>\n\n                <!-- Column 1: Core Systems (Skeuomorphic Dial/Status) -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col gap-8 anim-item\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-white/[0.05] pb-3\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-cyan-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Core Diagnostics\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Skeuomorphic Primary Node -->\n                    <div class=\"relative w-full aspect-square max-w-[280px] mx-auto rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group\"\n                         style=\"background: linear-gradient(145deg, #121826 0%, #080b12 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(255,255,255,0.03), inset 0 -2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 10px 20px -5px rgba(0,0,0,0.6); padding: 2px;\">\n\n                        <!-- Inner Bevel -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-full flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\"\n                             style=\"background: #030408; box-shadow: inset 0 4px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.9), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.02), 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n\n                            <!-- Screen Glare -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-[-50%] left-[-50%] w-[200%] h-full transform -rotate-12 pointer-events-none\"\n                                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), transparent);\"></div>\n\n                            <!-- Concentric rings -->\n                            <svg class=\"absolute inset-2 w-[calc(100%-16px)] h-[calc(100%-16px)] pointer-events-none opacity-40\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 100\">\n                                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#475569\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"/>\n                                <circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"50\" r=\"42\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#00f0ff\" stroke-width=\"0.5\" id=\"anim-ring\" stroke-dasharray=\"60 200\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n                            </svg>\n\n                            <!-- Center Data -->\n                            <div class=\"text-center z-10 flex flex-col items-center\">\n                                <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 tracking-[0.2em] mb-1\">NODE ALPHA</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-5xl font-light text-cyan-400 tracking-tight\"\n                                      style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; text-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,240,255,0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(0,240,255,0.2);\" id=\"data-core\">98</span>\n                                <div class=\"w-8 h-[2px] mt-2 rounded-full\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #00f0ff, transparent);\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Skeuomorphic Controls -->\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center px-4 py-3 rounded-lg mt-auto\"\n                         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30,41,59,0.4), rgba(15,23,42,0.4)); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05), 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\">\n                        <span class=\"text-xs text-slate-400\">Auxiliary Power</span>\n\n                        <!-- Custom Toggle -->\n                        <div class=\"w-10 h-5 rounded-full relative cursor-pointer group toggle-btn\"\n                             style=\"background: #020305; box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute top-[2px] left-[2px] w-4 h-4 rounded-full transition-transform duration-300 transform translate-x-5 knob\"\n                                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #38bdf8, #0284c7); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 8px rgba(56,189,248,0.5);\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Column 2: Data Routing (Linear Bars) -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 anim-item\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-white/[0.05] pb-3\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:routing-2-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-blue-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Vector Routing\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 mt-4\">\n                        <!-- Bar Item 1 -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs mb-2 font-medium\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-300\">Throughput Flux</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-cyan-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">12.4 TB/s</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Skeuomorphic Bar Track -->\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden relative\"\n                                 style=\"background: #05070a; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                                <!-- Bar Fill -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[75%] rounded-full relative overflow-hidden\"\n                                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1d4ed8, #00f0ff); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.3);\">\n                                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-30\" style=\"background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, transparent, transparent 4px, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 4px, rgba(255,255,255,0.2) 8px);\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Bar Item 2 -->\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full\">\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between text-xs mb-2 font-medium\">\n                                <span class=\"text-slate-300\">Encryption Matrix</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-blue-400\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">STABLE</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"w-full h-3 rounded-full overflow-hidden relative\"\n                                 style=\"background: #05070a; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\">\n                                <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 h-full w-[100%] rounded-full\"\n                                     style=\"background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e3a8a, #3b82f6); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.2);\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <!-- Data Readouts Grid -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-2\">\n                            <div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg flex flex-col\"\n                                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), transparent); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Latency</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-lg text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">4.2<span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 ml-1\">ms</span></span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"p-4 rounded-lg flex flex-col\"\n                                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), transparent); box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">Packet Loss</span>\n                                <span class=\"text-lg text-white\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">0.0<span class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 ml-1\">%</span></span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Column 3: Log & Readouts (Premium Border Gradients) -->\n                <div class=\"lg:col-span-4 p-6 lg:p-8 flex flex-col gap-6 anim-item\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest border-b border-white/[0.05] pb-3\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:document-text-linear\" class=\"text-lg text-slate-400\"></iconify-icon>\n                        System Logs\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Log Container with Gradient Border Skill -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-1 w-full rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative p-[1px] mt-2\"\n                         style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-xl flex flex-col p-4 relative\"\n                             style=\"background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0f1420 0%, #05070a 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden h-48\" id=\"log-container\">\n                                <!-- Log lines populated via JS -->\n                                <div class=\"text-xs flex gap-3 text-slate-400 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-cyan-500 opacity-60\">0x0A</span>\n                                    <span>Init quantum phase... OK</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs flex gap-3 text-slate-400 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-cyan-500 opacity-60\">0x0B</span>\n                                    <span>Bypass auth firewall... OK</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs flex gap-3 text-slate-300 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-blue-400 opacity-80\">0x0C</span>\n                                    <span>Syncing neural net... ACTIVE</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-xs flex gap-3 text-slate-500 font-light\" style=\"font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\">\n                                    <span class=\"opacity-40\">0x0D</span>\n                                    <span>Awaiting input...</span>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Fade out bottom -->\n                            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-12 pointer-events-none\"\n                                 style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #05070a, transparent);\"></div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. WebGL Background (Dither & Laser Skill) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl');\n\n        if (gl) {\n            const resize = () => {\n                canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n            };\n            window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n            resize();\n\n            const vsSource = `\n                attribute vec2 position;\n                void main() {\n                    gl_Position = vec4(position, 0.0, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            // Fragment Shader: 4x4 Bayer Dither + Vertical Soft Laser\n            const fsSource = `\n                precision highp float;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                uniform float u_time;\n\n                // Hash & Noise for smoke\n                float hash(vec2 p) { return fract(sin(dot(p, vec2(12.9898, 78.233))) * 43758.5453); }\n                float noise(vec2 p) {\n                    vec2 i = floor(p), f = fract(p);\n                    f = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                    return mix(mix(hash(i), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0)), f.x),\n                               mix(hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0)), hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0)), f.x), f.y);\n                }\n                float fbm(vec2 p) {\n                    float v = 0.0, a = 0.5;\n                    mat2 r = mat2(0.8, -0.6, 0.6, 0.8);\n                    for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) { v += a * noise(p); p = r * p * 2.0; a *= 0.5; }\n                    return v;\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n                    float aspect = u_resolution.x / u_resolution.y;\n\n                    // --- Laser Logic ---\n                    // Position offset slightly to balance the left-aligned header\n                    float laserX = 0.65;\n                    float dist = abs(uv.x - laserX) * aspect;\n\n                    // Thin core & soft halo\n                    float core = exp(-dist * 800.0) * 0.8;\n                    float halo = exp(-dist * 20.0) * 0.3;\n\n                    // Smoke restricted near the beam\n                    vec2 smokeUV = uv * vec2(4.0, 2.0) - vec2(0.0, u_time * 0.1);\n                    float smokeDensity = fbm(smokeUV + fbm(smokeUV + u_time * 0.05));\n                    float smokeMask = smoothstep(0.4, 0.0, dist);\n                    float smoke = smokeDensity * smokeMask * 0.5;\n\n                    // Colors\n                    vec3 darkBg = mix(vec3(0.02, 0.03, 0.05), vec3(0.01, 0.01, 0.02), uv.y);\n                    vec3 laserColor = vec3(0.0, 0.94, 1.0); // Cyan #00f0ff\n                    vec3 smokeColor = vec3(0.0, 0.5, 0.8);\n\n                    vec3 finalColor = darkBg + core + (halo * laserColor) + (smoke * smokeColor);\n\n                    // --- Dither Logic ---\n                    // Scale coordinates for visible square pixels\n                    float pixelScale = 3.0;\n                    vec2 coord = gl_FragCoord.xy / pixelScale;\n                    int x = int(mod(coord.x, 4.0));\n                    int y = int(mod(coord.y, 4.0));\n\n                    // 4x4 Bayer lookup\n                    float ditherVal = 0.0;\n                    if(x==0&&y==0) ditherVal=0.0; else if(x==2&&y==0) ditherVal=0.5; else if(x==1&&y==2) ditherVal=0.125; else if(x==3&&y==2) ditherVal=0.625;\n                    else if(x==2&&y==2) ditherVal=0.75; else if(x==0&&y==2) ditherVal=0.25; else if(x==3&&y==0) ditherVal=0.875; else if(x==1&&y==0) ditherVal=0.375;\n                    else if(x==1&&y==1) ditherVal=0.1875; else if(x==3&&y==1) ditherVal=0.6875; else if(x==0&&y==3) ditherVal=0.0625; else if(x==2&&y==3) ditherVal=0.5625;\n                    else if(x==3&&y==3) ditherVal=0.9375; else if(x==1&&y==3) ditherVal=0.4375; else if(x==2&&y==1) ditherVal=0.8125; else if(x==0&&y==1) ditherVal=0.3125;\n\n                    float luma = dot(finalColor, vec3(0.299, 0.587, 0.114));\n                    // Quantize brightness based on dither threshold, keeping the brightest parts (laser core) smooth\n                    float threshold = ditherVal * 0.3;\n                    if (luma < threshold && luma < 0.8) {\n                        finalColor *= 0.6; // Darken dither cells\n                    }\n\n                    // Vignette\n                    float vig = length(uv - 0.5);\n                    finalColor *= smoothstep(0.9, 0.2, vig);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const compileShader = (type, source) => {\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, source);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            };\n\n            const prog = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compileShader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource));\n            gl.attachShader(prog, compileShader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource));\n            gl.linkProgram(prog);\n            gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n            const posBuf = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, posBuf);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1, 1,-1, -1,1, 1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n            const posLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'position');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(posLoc);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(posLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const resLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_resolution');\n            const timeLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_time');\n\n            let start = Date.now();\n            const render = () => {\n                gl.uniform2f(resLoc, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                gl.uniform1f(timeLoc, (Date.now() - start) / 1000.0);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            };\n            render();\n        }\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Interactions & Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin();\n\n            // Initial Stagger Animation\n            gsap.fromTo(\".anim-item\",\n                { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.15, ease: \"power3.out\", delay: 0.2 }\n            );\n\n            // Ring rotation\n            gsap.to(\"#anim-ring\", {\n                rotation: 360,\n                transformOrigin: \"50% 50%\",\n                duration: 20,\n                repeat: -1,\n                ease: \"none\"\n            });\n\n            // Status bar equalizer effect\n            const bars = document.querySelectorAll('#status-bars div');\n            bars.forEach(bar => {\n                gsap.to(bar, {\n                    height: () => 12 + Math.random() * 16 + \"px\",\n                    duration: 0.4 + Math.random() * 0.4,\n                    repeat: -1,\n                    yoyo: true,\n                    ease: \"sine.inOut\"\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Toggle Interaction\n            const toggleWrapper = document.querySelector('.toggle-btn');\n            const knob = document.querySelector('.knob');\n            let isOn = true;\n\n            toggleWrapper.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                isOn = !isOn;\n                if (isOn) {\n                    gsap.to(knob, { x: 20, background: \"linear-gradient(180deg, #38bdf8, #0284c7)\", boxShadow: \"inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 8px rgba(56,189,248,0.5)\", duration: 0.3, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\" });\n                    gsap.to(toggleWrapper, { background: \"#020305\", duration: 0.3 });\n                } else {\n                    gsap.to(knob, { x: 0, background: \"linear-gradient(180deg, #64748b, #334155)\", boxShadow: \"inset 0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.5), 0 0 0px transparent\", duration: 0.3, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\" });\n                    gsap.to(toggleWrapper, { background: \"#080b12\", duration: 0.3 });\n                }\n            });\n\n            // Data Simulation\n            const coreEl = document.getElementById('data-core');\n            setInterval(() => {\n                if(!isOn) {\n                    coreEl.innerText = \"00\";\n                    return;\n                }\n                const val = Math.floor(95 + Math.random() * 5);\n                coreEl.innerText = val;\n            }, 2000);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "quantum-telemetry-nexus.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/quantum-telemetry-nexus.jpg", "source_name": "quantum-telemetry-nexus-DESIGN.md", "views": 80, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T23:42:48.287704+00:00"}